# HIGHLIGHTS ELECTRICAL ACADEMY

Welcome to Highlights Electrical Academy!

A free learning platform designed to teach electrical installation and solar energy from beginner to advanced level.

## What You Will Learn

- Basic Electrical Knowledge
- Electrical Wiring and Installation
- Electrical Tools and Equipment
- Solar Panel Installation
- Inverter Installation
- Battery Connections
- Electrical Safety
- Practical Projects

## Academy Features

- Step-by-step lessons
- Learning diagrams
- Educational videos
- Quizzes and examinations
- Progress tracking
- Electrical calculators
- English and Yoruba lessons

## Our Mission

To make electrical and solar installation education accessible and free for everyone.

Built by HIGHLIGHTS ELECTRICAL AND SOLAR WORKS.
